'''Zebstrika''' (Japanese: '''ゼブライカ''' ''Zebraika'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

